   1:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c **** /**************************************************************************************************
   2:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  * \file      cdd_sys_util.c
   3:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  * \brief     Implementation of the CddSys low-level system utility module.
   4:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
   5:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  * \details   Provides the definitions for every function declared in
   6:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            cdd_sys_util.h. Each function is a thin wrapper over one
   7:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            TriCore instruction (or a small sequence of them) and is
   8:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            defined with external linkage so it can be called from any
   9:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            translation unit in the CDD layer.
  10:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
  11:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            All public functions are defined without `extern` and without
  12:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            `static`: external linkage is the default for a function
  13:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            definition, and the compatible declaration is visible via the
  14:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            included header (MISRA C:2012 Rule 8.4).
  15:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
  16:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            There are no file-scope variables and no static helpers in this
  17:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            module - every function maps directly to an assembly sequence
  18:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            and is called from at least one other translation unit.
  19:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
  20:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            For the PMSM application layer that consumes these helpers,
  21:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *            see cdd_app.c. For GTM / ATOM configuration, see cdd_gtm_app.c.
  22:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
  23:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  * \note      MISRA C:2012 compliance:
  24:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.1 : All functions have explicit return type
  25:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.4 : Compatible declaration visible at every definition
  26:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.5 : One declaration per identifier
  27:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.6 : No definitions in header files
  28:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.7 : No static functions in this module (all are
  29:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *                            referenced from other translation units)
  30:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule  8.9 : File scope variables minimised (none here)
  31:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule 14.4 : All controlling expressions use explicit comparison
  32:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule 15.5 : Single exit point per function
  33:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule 17.2 : No recursion
  34:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Rule 18.4 : No non-constant pointer arithmetic
  35:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
  36:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  * \note      EmbedSim naming convention:
  37:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Functions      : Pascal_Snake_Case
  38:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Parameters     : PascalCase  (single-letter → Uppercase)
  39:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Output pointers: PascalCasePtr
  40:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Local variables: lowerPascalCase
  41:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Struct members : PascalCase
  42:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Macros         : UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
  43:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *              - Typedefs       : Pascal_Snake_Case_T
  44:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.c ****  *
