   1:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h **** /**************************************************************************************************
   2:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  * \file      cdd_sys_util.h
   3:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  * \brief     Public interface for the CddSys low-level system utility module.
   4:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *
   5:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  * \details   Declares the CddSys function API used across the CDD layer for
   6:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *            TriCore-specific primitives:
   7:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Atomic bit-field load-modify-store (LDMST instruction).
   8:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Binary semaphore via compare-and-swap (CMPSWAP.W instruction).
   9:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Single and multi-instruction NOP delays.
  10:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Interrupt-enable intrinsic.
  11:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *
  12:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *
