  14:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Functions      : Pascal_Snake_Case
  15:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Parameters     : PascalCase  (single-letter → Uppercase)
  16:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Output pointers: PascalCasePtr
  17:../complex_device_driver/cdd_sys_util.h ****  *              - Local variables: lowerPascalCase
